 "brief": "Gaza's health ministry warned that a critical shortage of generator fuel oil threatens to halt power at medical facilities across the territory, Shehab Wire reported. The ministry said the crisis now jeopardizes hospitals' ability to operate the generators needed to meet daily electricity demands.\n\nThe fuel shortage has intensified as Gaza's health infrastructure remains dependent on diesel generators due to ongoing power cuts. Without adequate fuel supplies, medical facilities risk losing capacity to maintain essential services.",
